label live-@FLAVOUR@
	menu label ^Beamo Wipe: start the erase guide
	menu default
	text help
Opens the Beamo Wipe guide. Nothing is erased until you pick a disk and confirm it.
	endtext
	linux @LINUX@
	initrd @INITRD@
	append @APPEND_LIVE@

label live-@FLAVOUR@-speech
	menu label Beamo Wipe: ^speech for screen readers
	text help
Starts the same guide with spoken output (Orca). Nothing is erased until you pick a disk and confirm it.
	endtext
	linux @LINUX@
	initrd @INITRD@
	append @APPEND_LIVE@ beamo.ui=accessible

label live-@FLAVOUR@-failsafe
	menu label Beamo Wipe: ^troubleshoot startup
	text help
Same guide with safe video settings. Nothing is erased until you pick a disk and confirm it.
	endtext
	linux @LINUX@
	initrd @INITRD@
	append @APPEND_LIVE_FAILSAFE@
